<title>UK: Accor places 1.8 pct of Compass stake.</title>
<headline>Accor places 1.8 pct of Compass stake.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>French hotel group Accor SA placed 1.8 percent of its 23.4 percent stake in UK catering group Compass Group Plc through brokerage ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, market sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Compass shares were down 8p to 612 in active trade of 11.6 million shares by 1134 GMT.</p>
<p>In Paris Accor shares were up one franc at 630 francs.</p>
<p>No-one at Accor or Compass was immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
